ent-RUMCWoodenAxe = wooden axe
    .desc = An axe all of hard wood, its edge fire-hardened. It fells a tree and splits a log, but it will not last: some twenty-five blows, and it is gone.
ent-RUMCStoneAxe = stone axe
    .desc = An axe with a head of flaked stone lashed to a haft. It fells a tree and splits a log better than the wooden one and lasts some sixty blows.
ent-RUMCFlintStriker = flint striker
    .desc = Two stones to strike a spark from. Hold it to a campfire or a stove with fuel in it, or to something that burns, and strike. Not every strike catches, and the stones wear down.

au14-craft-recipe-wooden-axe = Wooden axe
au14-craft-recipe-stone-axe = Stone axe
au14-craft-recipe-flint-striker = Flint striker

au14-striker-miss = The spark dies out.
au14-striker-set-fire = The { $target } catches fire.
